Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干杯  干杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cheers. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你全身泡泡好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look cute in bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝太多眼花了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh, you're just all liquored up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  我进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's me. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天上班累死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've had a very long, hard day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去买炸鸡   你要不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh, I'm gonna go get some chicken. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  谢谢  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh, no thanks. No chicken, bye-bye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定  炸鸡  不要海鲜饭或豆子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure? Some extra crispy? Dirty rice? Beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次说  不要了  出去  出去  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For the last time, no! Get out, Get out, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  抱歉  他赖着不走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? I'm so sorry, he wouldn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.17,0:00:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缠着我问要不要炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He kept asking me if I wanted chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想吃炸鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could eat some chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:00:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要三块鸡  沙扛  豆子  可乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, can I get a, uh, three-piece, some coleslaw, some beans and a Coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,健怡可乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Diet Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第02集  热吻连连\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E02  The One With All The Kissing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安  菲比  我非告诉你们不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning, Pheebs. I have to tell you this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才载我来的司机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I was coming over and this cabdriver...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人是不是叫做安格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was his name Angus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在伦敦碰到的计程车司机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was a cabdriver we had in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  总之...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他载我们去的那个酒馆叫什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was that pub he took us to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦子酒馆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Wheat Sheaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有一种啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they had that beer...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伯丁罕  就是伯丁罕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boddington's. Boddington's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比有话要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, uh, Pheebs was going to tell a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的帽子很好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so, he had a really funny hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伯丁罕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boddington's!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是能再喝一杯  要我走回伦敦都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was good beer. Y'know, I'd walk back to London for another frosty one of those bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世贸附近的英国酒馆好像有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I think they have those at that British pub near the trade center.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋不是该回来了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't Rachel supposed to be back by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那趟班机在雅典误点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but her plane got delayed in Athens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  现在也该到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But actually, she should be here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟她通过电话  她很生气吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, so-so you talked to her. Did she, did she sound mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  那是因为她喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. But she likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你丢她独自飞到希腊去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You abandoned her on a plane to Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有 "丢下" 瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I did not "abandon" Rachel. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉出现在机场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily showed up at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然得去追她  我别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to go after her. I mean, I-I did what I had to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我的太太  瑞秋是我太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's my wife. Rachel is my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know—Emily!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉是我老婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily is my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有艾蜜莉的消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you still hadn't heard from Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在机场追丢之后就没有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Not since I lost her at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然跑得比你快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe she can out run you man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是飞毛腿  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! She's fast, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你可以打击我   现在就出去单挑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! You think you can beat me? Let's go! Outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我很抱歉  非常对不起你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, I am so sorry. I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  你迫不得已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. You just did what you had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  你不生气  你一定很难受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it? You're not mad? I mean, It must've been terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难受   我到的可是希腊啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Terrible? Hell, I was in Greece!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿有豪华的酒店  迷人的沙滩  人又和善\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There was a nice hotel, nice beach, met the nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我瑞秋来说可不差啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not too shabby for Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  就这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们和好了  我没生你的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah. We're cool. Totally cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  瑞秋  你是最棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, Rach. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不  你才是最棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去花店一趟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I got to go to the flower store.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来  大家都不肯说艾蜜莉在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check it out, No one will tell me where Emily is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我决定买72朵长茎红玫瑰  寄到艾蜜莉爸妈家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I'm gonna send 72 long-stemmed, red roses to her parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每朵代表我认识她   并且深爱她的每一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}one for each day that I've known and loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定会感动的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That oughta get her talking to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  罗斯  写卡片时别忘了  对方是 "艾蜜莉"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Ross,When you make out the card, be sure to make it out to "Emily."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  太棒了  幸好你在希腊玩得开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, that's great! It's so good that you had a good time in Greece!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在希腊才不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't have a good time in Greece!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯丢下我一人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross abandoned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我买不到机票回来  只好住在他们的蜜月套房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I couldn't get a plane out. so I had to stay in their honeymoon suite
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都要来问我 "盖勒太太  你哭什么"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with people coming up to me all the time going, "Oh, Mrs. Geller, why are you crying"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直丢死人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it was so humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就像个白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I felt like such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是我的错  你们知道为什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's all my fault. And you know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的决定都不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I make very bad decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样  我没胡说  我跑去愚蠢的伦敦追罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it is true. I went,I went after Ross in stupid London!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伦敦的确是个蠢地方  太蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}London is stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比你是对的  我根本不该去伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you were right. I should've never gone to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从今开始   由你帮我做决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and from now on, you make all my decisions for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我以前就这么做过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. I did that for someone once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢主宰别人的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not comfortable having that kind of power and control over someone's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  摩妮卡  以后由你主宰我的感情生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's fine. So Monica, you are now in charge of my love life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我该去上班了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I got to go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  很高兴看到你回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, Rachel, great to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到你真开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel? Sweetie, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你跟乔伊在招待会的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's a really cute picture of Joey and you at the reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, He's married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯结婚了  我到现在还不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross is married. I can't-I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  抓旁边就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, sweetie, by the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我只好接受事实了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, y'know I'm just gonna have to accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都要怪我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  抓边上  指纹弄脏照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweetie! Edges! Fingers! Smudgey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  我知道你心情低落\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. That's okay. I know that you're very upset right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是故意找我麻烦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know that wasn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看她就是跟她作对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet it was about her a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是肯放下罗斯一分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you'd stop thinking about Ross for one minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会发现这里到处有帅哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you'd notice there are great guys everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  阿甘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you look. Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他既善良又可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's nice. He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘的确...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I guess Gunther is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那边那个家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about that guy over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗  你以前  跟他在柜台打情骂俏过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember? That's the guy you flirted with at the counter that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在就去跟他说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're going to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说好了  由我发号施今  我决定你去跟他说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? We made a deal, I make your decisions and I say you're going to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说了算  看来我只好照办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the boss. I guess. I got to do what you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他听到这句话  肯定上钩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say that to him, and you're golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  伦敦的照片洗出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. We got our pictures back from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这张是所有人在伦敦塔拍的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's all of us at the Tower of London...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在照片中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有罗斯  乔伊  你...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, There's Ross and Joey and you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定听烦我们说伦敦的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know what, we've been talking about London too much haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我不好  因为我去不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I'm sorry. it's just because I couldn't be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能大着肚子  烦都快烦死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause all I ever get to do now is pregnant stuff, it just bums me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜啊  真抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  总之我们东扯西扯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened? Well, y'know, A little of this, a little of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天晚上要出去约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got myself a date tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  早告诉过你  你能忘了罗斯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? Didn't I tell you? You're getting over Ross already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（我们有权利拒绝服务）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么去了那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公事担搁了  不过我明天就辞职\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got caught up at work. But I'm quitting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你邀我过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So thanks for having me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他发什么神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能在伦敦学到的欧洲风俗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Probably some European goodbye thing he picked up in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是欧洲风俗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not European.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比较像法式热吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, It felt French.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我玩得好开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh God, I really had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想进来  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless you want to come inside? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我做不了主\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, wait a minute. You know what? I can't decide this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡在吗  我有事要问她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is Monica around? I have to ask her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去洗衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doing her laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天收到的包裹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It came in the mail today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,72朵长茎红玫瑰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's uh, 72 long-stemmed, red roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每朵代表我认识她  并且深爱她的每一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One for each day that I've known and loved Emily...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却给剪成了碎片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...cut up into mulch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey that's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡要用它来做香料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's going to make potpourri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去淋雨散散心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I'm going to go wander out in the rain for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面没下雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连老天都不赏脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't catch a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你哪也别去  就坐这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what Ross? You're not going anywhere. Sit right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你泡茶  然后我们聊聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna make you a cup of tea and we're gonna talk this thing whole out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Dave. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  改天再请你进来  我的室友病得很重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, listen, I'm gonna need to take a rain check, my roommate is just really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:10:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道事情感觉很糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know things seem so bad right now..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来不会好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that they won't get any...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跟你谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I talk to for just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我掉了几只袜子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I dropped some socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想惹麻烦吗  你又想老调重弹  又想跳回去自找苦吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the matter with you? Do you want to fall into the trap? Do you want to fall into the trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没掉袜子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You did not drop any socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚碰到大卫  他说你打发他走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just ran into Dave, and he told me that you blew him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要发号施令了  我要你离开罗斯去追大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I'm calling the shots! I say you leave Ross and go get Dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell were you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我想  我打算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, ultimately I was trying, you know, I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他我还爱他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...tell him y'know, that I'm still in love with him..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你不准说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You cannot tell him that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么不准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都喜欢听到这种话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People love to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里由我做决定  我不准你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I make the decisions and I say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  你不能帮我做决定   因为...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, You know what? No, you don't make my decisions, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要开除你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能开除我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't fire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的事情由我来决定  我说 "我没被开除"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I make your decisions, and I say, "I'm not fired!" Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  让我进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel! Come on, let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Having some trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋把我锁在门外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel locked the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯亲我  我就帮你撞开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll kick that door in if you give me some sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  让我进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我可以去外面跟你谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel? Can I talk to you outside for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的有话要跟你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We really need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就说啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我们刚说你要做的事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember that thing we just discussed that you wanted to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋要去学摇摆舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel wants to take swing dance lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常不赞成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which I think is a really stupid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这种舞很危险  她一定学不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's dangerous. she's never gonna get what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且搞不好还会撞伤人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who knows who she might end up hurting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡说得对  摇摆舞有点危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's right. Swing dancing can be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to use the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要取消五只  送给艾蜜莉的熊宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got to cancel those five, giant teddy bears I sent to Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则熊宝宝难逃死劫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God. Think of the massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我知道你认为我疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, I know-I know you think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在你告诉他之前  至少找到一个...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But before you tell him you love him, just-just try to find one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同意你想法的人  我打赌你找不到  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who thinks it's a good idea. I bet you can't. But I…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我已经进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs! Hey! Pheebs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, okay, Pheebs? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上次说你都不能去伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, y'know how the other day you were talking about how you didn't get to go to London ...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得自己遭到大家遗弃  如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you were feeling left out? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们对这事很愧疚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we all felt really bad about that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,决定大家一起去旅行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we decided to take a little trip together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  要去哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How great! where? Where's the trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一起去野餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we thought we would all go to a picnic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就去中央公园   中央公园\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in Central Park! Central Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  大家一起去  一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, All of us. All day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鸟地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那根本不算旅行  我才刚从公园过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not a trip! I just came from the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家去中央公园有什么好兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we gonna high five about at the stupid Central Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  就在我家旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's right by my house. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我决定回家反省这个烂主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going home to bask in the triumph of my Central Park idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  热吻先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on a sec there, Mr. Kissy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想跟你讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I've been meaning to talk to you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你新学的欧洲民情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...this whole, little, new European thing you've got going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞得我非常不自在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I just need to tell you that it makes me very uncomfortable...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你别再亲了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I just, you know, just stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想  介绍大家认识欧洲文化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just trying to bring a little culture to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要不要介绍到我嘴里就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's fine. Just don't bring it in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都快吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Makes me wanna puke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  菲比来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody! Pheebs is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  大家好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe! Whoo! Okay. Whoo! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们认为野餐的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Pheebs, we decided that the picnic idea was a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在是没什么意思  不去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It didn't have any... Well, it blew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天下午决定  到大西洋城\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, we thought that this afternoon we'd all go away for the whole weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去度周末\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大西洋城  太好了  谁想到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, Atlantic City! Oh, that's a great plan! Whose plan was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   是我提议的  错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. It was my plan. No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们应该想个新的计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I said we needed a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我想到要去大西洋城\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I came up with Atlantic City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是新的计划啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is the new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家一小时后楼上见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, why don't we all meet upstairs in an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去打包了  我要摇着大屁股好好打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to go pack. I'm going to go pack my ass off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on Rach, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等一下再上去找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, y'know what? I'm-I'm gonna meet you upstairs in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  瑞秋  没有人支持你  所以你不能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Rachel, you didn't find anyone, so you can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, You know what? That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道对方不能回应你的爱意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rachel, do you have any idea how painful it is to tell someone you love them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会有多痛苦吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and not have them say it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我看不下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,报纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界各地的新闻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The events from around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有件事要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh, Ross, there's something that I-that I have to talk to you about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然大家都叫我别说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and everybody's saying that I shouldn't tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们都错了  有时候别人就是看不清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I think they're wrong. I mean, and you know how people can be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次上班时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Once at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说放射性碳测定法太老旧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I thought carbon dating is fossilized...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的有话跟你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really trying to tell you something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, okay, I think I'm-I'm just gonna-just gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just gonna say it. Uhh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还爱着你  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still in love with you, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道现在该怎么回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Umm...Huh...I'm-I'm not sure what to do with that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你跟我开玩笑  这就太恶劣了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Was that a joke? Because it's mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很正经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so dead serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能再正经了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm totally serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你笑什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我刚听到自己的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I just heard it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了  而且觉得很荒谬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I heard it! And it's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're married!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经结婚  我说这话太可笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're married, and it's just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:19:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说话时似乎灵魂出壳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and it's like, When I said it, I sort of floated up out of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的灵魂听到肉身说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know? And then I heard myself say it, and then the floating Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂认为  自己实在很白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was like, "You are such an idiot!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的确已经结婚   我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I am married. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然婚礼后就没跟老婆说过话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even though I haven't spoken to my wife since the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  这不好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  还蛮好笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, it kind of is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆不回我电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My wife won't return my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道太太在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know where my wife is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"罗斯  你老婆呢 "  "我也不知道"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Hey, Ross! Where's the missus?" "Don't know!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:20:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以忘记我刚说的话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? do you think that you just forget that I told you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不忘记也不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I kind of have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为事实是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, Because the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实就是你已经娶了艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The thing is, you know, that you're married to Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实正是如此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is what the thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我们还是好朋友吧  我说自己还爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, Things won't be weird between us, right? Was that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是蠢死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me telling you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不会  我很高兴你告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算日子不顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, If nothing else...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到有人说爱你还是很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's always great when someone tells you they love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你对我这么好  我才该谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for being so nice. No. Thank you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家走吧  去大西洋城\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's go! Yeah, Atlantic City!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去大西洋城了  宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Atlantic City, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去大赌一笔  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's roll some bones. Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赌博万岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}High-five for rolling bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你尿失禁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Pheebs, you're leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你羊水破了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Your water broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别放在心上  我要坐前座\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, don't worry. I call shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们得送你去医院\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, we have to take you to the hospital now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   你快要生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, the babies are coming now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,击掌   你要生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey! High-five! The babies are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  记不记得  我羊水破的那天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait,Remember when my water broke?
